<LegalLayout title="Centrix Website Terms" description="Terms for using centrix.ie and how website information relates to Centrix services.">
  <p>These terms explain how you may use centrix.ie and how website information relates to Centrix services. Centrix is based at Downestown, Duleek, Co. Meath, Ireland. For questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@centrix.ie">info@centrix.ie</a>.</p>
  <h2>1 Website use and paid services</h2>
  <p>These terms apply to this website. Viewing the website, submitting an enquiry or requesting a consultation does not purchase a service or authorise chargeable work.</p>
  <p>Paid services are agreed separately through an accepted written quotation, scope and applicable service terms. Those documents set the deliverables, fees, payment dates, responsibilities, support and other commercial arrangements. They take precedence over these website terms for the services concerned. A data processing agreement applies where we process client personal data on the client’s behalf.</p>
