  <p>Website content describes our services and provides general technology information. It is not a binding offer, a service level commitment or advice tailored to your circumstances. Confirm availability, pricing, compatibility and important technical details with us before relying on them for a purchase or implementation.</p>
  <p>We aim to keep information accurate and current, but services and supplier offerings change. Examples illustrate possible work and do not guarantee a result. Security and compliance readiness services do not constitute legal advice, regulatory approval or a guarantee that systems will remain free from incidents.</p>
  <h2>3 Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Use the website lawfully and do not interfere with other people’s access or information. You must not attempt unauthorised access, introduce malware, disrupt availability, bypass controls, impersonate another person or send fraudulent, abusive or unlawful material.</p>
  <p>Do not carry out intrusive testing, exploitation, high-volume scanning or social engineering against Centrix, client or supplier systems without appropriate written authorisation. Our <a href="/security-reporting">Security and Vulnerability Reporting Policy</a> explains how to report concerns safely. Reporting a concern does not itself authorise testing.</p>
  <h2>4 Information you send us</h2>
