  <p>You retain your rights in submitted material. We may receive, review and use it to handle your enquiry and agreed next steps. An enquiry does not give us permission to publish your material, logo or testimonial. Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Notice</a> explains our use of personal data.</p>
